            <p rend="justify">[Image unavailable.]</p>
            <p rend="justify">
               <hi rend="italic">Sympathetic plain friend to inconsolable young widow:</hi>  The last time I met your dear husband he stopped and spoke to me with such a sunny greeting that I was the happier for it all day long.</p>
            <p rend="justify">
               <hi rend="italic">Young widow</hi>  (<hi rend="italic">still oblivious to everything except her loss</hi>): Yes, that was just like dear David. There was no woman so humble or homely, or unattractive, or dull, but that he could find something pleasant to say to her, and would take pains to say it.—</p>
